[size=6][b]Weightless Gold[/b][/size]

Gold no longer counts toward your carry weight. In the base game every coin weighs a little, so a big purse quietly fills your inventory (10,000 gold is 10 kg). With this mod it weighs nothing.

[line]
[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Download the mod from [url=https://github.com/belakarkache/bg3-weightless-gold/releases]GitHub Releases[/url].
[*]In [b]BG3 Mod Manager[/b], import the [font=Courier New].pak[/font], enable [b]Weightless Gold[/b] and click [b]Export Load Order to Game[/b].
[*]Start the game. Gold now weighs 0.
[/list]

[line]
[size=4][b]Known issues[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]It overrides the shared [font=Courier New]_Gold[/font] stat, so it conflicts with any other mod that changes gold weight. Whichever loads last wins.
[*]Only gold. Coin pouches, gems and trade goods keep their normal weight.
[*]Not tested in multiplayer.
[/list]

